{"id":"n62839-13-7","stage":0,"title":"끊다 · 挂断","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62839-13-7-1","ko":"전화로 무슨 얘기가 그렇게 기니?","zh":"电话里聊什么聊那么久？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"전화로","meaning":"电话","explanation":"전화：电话；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20260","senseId":"2","lemma":"전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얘기가","meaning":"聊天","explanation":"얘기：聊天；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"2","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기니?","meaning":"长，久","explanation":"길다：长，久；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"길다","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26808","senseId":"2","lemma":"길다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6db518d738ede991","term":"전화","zh":"电话","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3","entryId":"20260","definition":"人们通过电话机交谈；或指通过那样传达的内容。","pronunciation":["전ː화"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc","term":"얘기","zh":"聊天","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3","entryId":"74194","definition":"和他人交替着说话。","pronunciation":["얘ː기"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"013e520a738e476f","term":"길다","zh":"长，久","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3","entryId":"26808","definition":"从一个时间到另一个时间相隔甚远。","pronunciation":["길ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/48e04f987cc2cb24d8b5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62839-13-7-2","ko":"곧 끊을 거예요.","zh":"我马上就挂。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"곧","meaning":"马上，就","explanation":"곧：马上，就","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"1","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끊을","meaning":"挂断，切断","explanation":"끊다：挂断，切断；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"끊다","audio":"/audio/c2d51c5ca94e5957669b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62839","senseId":"13","lemma":"끊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"马上，就","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"不拖延，紧接着。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"c2d51c5ca94e5957","term":"끊다","zh":"挂断，切断","audio":"/audio/c2d51c5ca94e5957669b.mp3","entryId":"62839","definition":"中断用电话或互联网进行的对话或意见交流。","pronunciation":["끈타"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/75bb209a48576e6181bf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.48,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62839","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"13","sourceLevel":"초급","day":19